    "detailed_description": "Cursed House 7 is a Match 3 Puzzle game. It features 2 sets of levels: for fans of challenging gameplay and for regular players. The bonus system has also been changed; only one figure can create power-ups. If this figure is not present in a level, it won't be possible to create power-ups in that level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdditionally, new mechanics have been added to the game - electricity and papyrus.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game includes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n105 Match 3 levels<br />\r\n2 Hidden Object scenes<br />\r\n8 Spot the difference scenes<br />\r\n20 solitaires<br />\r\nA new location to cleanse from the evil spirits",
